  "question": "计算 $I = \\int_{-1}^{1}\\mathrm{d}x\\int_{0}^{\\sqrt{1 - x^2}}\\mathrm{d}y\\int_{1}^{1 + \\sqrt{1 - x^2 - y^2}}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{x^2 + y^2 + z^2}}\\mathrm{d}z.$",
  "answer": "$I = \\dfrac{\\pi}{6}(7 - 4\\sqrt{2})$",
  "ref_source": "textbook:puheping_math_contest_v2",
  "techniques": [
    "球面坐标",
    "极坐标变换",
    "积分估值",
    "累次积分"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "s1",
        "text": "分析 若直接计算，则积分较困难，易知积分区域是球形区域的一部分，被积函数是 $f(x^{2} + y^{2} + z^{2})$ 的类型，因此选用球面坐标系计算为好."
      },
      {
        "id": "s2",
        "text": "积分区域为 $\\Omega: 1 \\leqslant z \\leqslant 1 + \\sqrt{1 - x^2 - y^2}, 0 \\leqslant y \\leqslant \\sqrt{1 - x^2}, -1 \\leqslant x \\leqslant 1.$"
      },
      {
        "id": "s3",
        "text": "如图5.19所示，在球面坐标系中，边界曲面 $z = 1 + \\sqrt{1 - x^2 - y^2}$ 和 $z = 1$ 的方程分别为 $r = 2\\cos \\theta$ 和 $r = \\frac{1}{\\cos\\theta}$ 。两曲面的交线满足 $\\theta = \\frac{\\pi}{4}$ 。积分区域为"
      },
      {
        "id": "s4",
        "text": "$$\n\\Omega : \\frac {1}{\\cos \\theta} \\leqslant r \\leqslant 2 \\cos \\theta , 0 \\leqslant \\theta \\leqslant \\frac {\\pi}{4}, 0 \\leqslant \\varphi \\leqslant \\pi .\n$$"
      },
      {
        "id": "s5",
        "text": "所以"
      },
      {
        "id": "s6",
        "text": "$$\n\\begin{array}{l} I = \\iiint_ {\\Omega} \\frac {1}{r} r ^ {2} \\sin \\theta \\mathrm{d} \\theta \\mathrm{d} \\varphi \\mathrm{d} r = \\int_ {0} ^ {\\pi} \\mathrm{d} \\varphi \\int_ {0} ^ {\\frac {\\pi}{4}} \\sin \\theta \\mathrm{d} \\theta \\int_ {\\frac {1}{\\cos \\theta}} ^ {2 \\cos \\theta} r \\mathrm{d} r \\\\ = \\frac {1}{2} \\pi \\int_ {0} ^ {\\frac {\\pi}{4}} \\sin \\theta \\left(4 \\cos^ {2} \\theta - \\frac {1}{\\cos^ {2} \\theta}\\right) \\mathrm{d} \\theta = \\frac {\\pi}{6} (7 - 4 \\sqrt {2}). \\end{array}\n$$"
      },
      {
        "id": "s7",
        "text": "图5.19"
      }
    ],
    "final_answer": "$I = \\dfrac{\\pi}{6}(7 - 4\\sqrt{2})$",
